# Applies to the Go API's build context (backend/) — see go-api/Dockerfile's
# header comment for why the context is backend/, not backend/go-api/.
#
# The Python ML service is a separate build with its own context
# (backend/ml/) and its own .dockerignore there — excluded here so it never
# gets pulled into the Go image, which has no use for it.
ml/

go-api/**/*_test.go
.git/
.gitignore
*.md
